# ui.exponential.at: a tiny image for apps/site/scripts/ui-redirect.ts (the
# Coolify app `exponential-ui-site`, dockerfile build pack). It needs only the
# script and src/redirects.ts, never the monorepo or its node_modules.
FROM oven/bun:1-alpine
WORKDIR /app
COPY apps/site/src/redirects.ts src/redirects.ts
COPY apps/site/scripts/ui-redirect.ts scripts/ui-redirect.ts
ENV PORT=3000
EXPOSE 3000
USER bun
CMD ["bun", "scripts/ui-redirect.ts"]
